'''Cinders''' is a [[trigger]]ed [[spell]] granted by {{il|The Flame of Hope}}. 

__TOC__

==Skill functions and interactions==
While active, [[bow]] attacks inflict Cinderflame, a stackable [[fire]] [[damage over time]] debuff that deals 333.3 base fire damage per second for 3 seconds, and can stack up to 10 times.

